  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "黃河岸邊的驢子，低垂著頭，纖細的腿，披著破舊的毛皮，漫遊於無邊的蒼老曠野，彷彿枯樹根在世間重新活動起來。",
      "output_sha256": "cc311991ca537cae7f288e9d561b8d1a4b02fe40fc22d758adf7bf575005c6cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.525319,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "de2c825da7288d2f5c8055cabac0cd3c5ad786669572ed1068def204ba11b10f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cc311991ca537cae7f288e9d561b8d1a4b02fe40fc22d758adf7bf575005c6cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "它們的眼睛永遠爲了遮天的沙土而垂着淚，鼻子的響聲永遠攪在黃色的大風裏，那沙沙的足音，只有在黃昏以後，一切都停息了的時候才能聽到。",
      "output_sha256": "0ac416d82dabf7fcf8103ee25440e04d3f7f33654c9b029de24de798f6121bbc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ac416d82dabf7fcf8103ee25440e04d3f7f33654c9b029de24de798f6121bbc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而四川的轎伕，同樣也發出那沙沙的聲音。",
      "output_sha256": "53f8f10e91ea3c0565b0b04d498750de26328b31f0964d1c909777ba9dede634",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.802059,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9927ac8629b1ae7570605d96d17d6384ae81163d785d73e8abffe43f3b954cfd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "53f8f10e91ea3c0565b0b04d498750de26328b31f0964d1c909777ba9dede634",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "下坡路，他們的腿，輕捷得連他們自己也不能夠止住，蹣跚地他們控制了這狹小的山路。",
      "output_sha256": "4f9c388942dc6c373a9ac9af15154877c7122a42eadeb11c5753ca194d090aa3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f9c388942dc6c373a9ac9af15154877c7122a42eadeb11c5753ca194d090aa3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他們的血液驕傲地跳動着，好像他們停止了呼吸，只聽到草鞋觸着石級的聲音。",
      "output_sha256": "2332b15dd2ba76f212f34a561b0c3eeeb7e7ec8bd1c55993129011c91bae90fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "2332b15dd2ba76f212f34a561b0c3eeeb7e7ec8bd1c55993129011c91bae90fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在山澗中，在流泉旁，在煙霧裡，還有那淒慘細雨飄落的斜坡上，他們一邊呼喊著：左手！",
      "output_sha256": "b71939d16c975e3ad9fe08308f2565af9f46579a496f1713a7afaa10e96650af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.610846,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "876ab166b04d0c00b271c9a5e9dca588443277e42a0a519908c5837e4a2a092f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b71939d16c975e3ad9fe08308f2565af9f46579a496f1713a7afaa10e96650af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "迎面走來的，擔着草鞋的擔子，揹着青菜的孩子，牽着一條黃牛的老頭，趕着三個小豬的女人，他們也都爲着這下山的轎子讓開路。",
      "output_sha256": "dd29579a94c5a3884d6c60b7469e89c772a42223bb9b7eb5205eacd1bb3ca2e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd29579a94c5a3884d6c60b7469e89c772a42223bb9b7eb5205eacd1bb3ca2e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因為他們的步伐如同流泉般快速，絲毫沒有停下的意思。",
      "output_sha256": "82ac6a8a57274a9db0695baf8f9cfdd6a0bf8ec1b7dec968a197a58868e435ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.350938,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5b5f3fe8a2a6be5a054cbb35165f829c1d0e37bd2ac69453d7d23d27a97b331"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "82ac6a8a57274a9db0695baf8f9cfdd6a0bf8ec1b7dec968a197a58868e435ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當他們到達拔坡之時，腳步聲漸漸消失。",
      "output_sha256": "afb5401e831e2acd520ed4214412aacaf580ddc877c92dd165e3e410f6deabeb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.448589,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9a420dc1e81b131f41e3a8facef81b16dfe2762a341a06c40fc14e9eda9cbee7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "afb5401e831e2acd520ed4214412aacaf580ddc877c92dd165e3e410f6deabeb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "遇見其他行人時，他們呼喊的左手或右手的聲音，雖然粗糙卻不強烈。",
      "output_sha256": "ed5ee08b1029cffec792957c33a0321306c95b47c94321aa1df0be9c7f47f877",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.5325,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "67eb879af72b10a6266df39a464542567fd0fcd7a56253423957dc93d4c977c8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ed5ee08b1029cffec792957c33a0321306c95b47c94321aa1df0be9c7f47f877",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因爲他們開始喘息，他們的肺葉開始擴張，發出來好像風扇在他們的胸膛裏煽起來的聲音，那破片做的衣裳在吱吱響的轎子下面，有秩序的向左或向右地擺動。",
      "output_sha256": "e61c228c2cac0cec82e3f19e2620163262a43542db9ea624fe958c74d0e66df1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "e61c228c2cac0cec82e3f19e2620163262a43542db9ea624fe958c74d0e66df1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "汗珠在頭髮梢上靜靜地站着，他們走得當心而出奇的慢，而轎子仍舊像要破碎了似的叫。",
      "output_sha256": "42619f0ab87f02285aeb2f2fb960f2d3587b21c4e94ff9f2a11912a1c7202926",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "42619f0ab87f02285aeb2f2fb960f2d3587b21c4e94ff9f2a11912a1c7202926",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "像是迎着大風向前走，像是海船臨靠岸時遇到了潮頭一樣困難。",
      "output_sha256": "4a93d36b394d955243a8168eb43f4336a3a40e3110a47ce4b0d637cd09ba7978",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a93d36b394d955243a8168eb43f4336a3a40e3110a47ce4b0d637cd09ba7978",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他們並不是巨象，卻發出來巨象呼喘似的聲音。",
      "output_sha256": "91038544c0b64263b5cd2d87737dc421f18699b98f21f7147a7746ce2ef89294",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "91038544c0b64263b5cd2d87737dc421f18699b98f21f7147a7746ce2ef89294",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "早晨他們吃了一碗四個大銅板一碗的面，晚上再吃一碗，一天八個大銅板。",
      "output_sha256": "857b841599b190a7d4e31b6f885d0f7c89f87d6a9be91384715c064d255cc4b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "857b841599b190a7d4e31b6f885d0f7c89f87d6a9be91384715c064d255cc4b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "甚或有一天不吃什麼的，只要抽一點鴉片就可以。",
      "output_sha256": "ba34d090fbd475ee0cfbadde1c42e050114be6403672cec002e8730dba177ec2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "ba34d090fbd475ee0cfbadde1c42e050114be6403672cec002e8730dba177ec2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此他們顯得瘦弱而蒼白，有的甚至像化石般透亮。",
      "output_sha256": "9c4beccd16b41f92575825be22847721bbc4c457e80243ad7de8681bd9b02f28",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.487202,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "25da77bcf2fd81a13967931b955ce82cba1ca5f12847353e0da0ce857d3bc1fd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9c4beccd16b41f92575825be22847721bbc4c457e80243ad7de8681bd9b02f28",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "若讓他們自己支持着自己都有點奇怪，他們隨時要倒下來的樣子。",
      "output_sha256": "f368d794ae021edfcb16431fc14284a7e9926fbdb5d6e224625dbbfc07e8344d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "f368d794ae021edfcb16431fc14284a7e9926fbdb5d6e224625dbbfc07e8344d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，上下山的人卻依然在他們的肩上擔著重任。",
      "output_sha256": "9df775a347957e4e6f2deb6c344aec50dfe0182778ef7478022f14d0f67e2934",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.606892,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e16582b7851bf2f22c3914319df61b73e8abdf2089114ff24dc89cd102a45eda"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9df775a347957e4e6f2deb6c344aec50dfe0182778ef7478022f14d0f67e2934",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有一次，我偶然和他們聊起製作爆竹的方法，其中一位轎伕不僅知道如何製作爆竹，還懂得製作槍藥的道理。",
      "output_sha256": "57eabcdbb22bf939763204846c49f52aed5f02155188f628a8509251d28156af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.578723,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bcf268959d74ba60852e3ce0d34ee11c5917a1bd7b98c6effba46863f2f7ab56"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "57eabcdbb22bf939763204846c49f52aed5f02155188f628a8509251d28156af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他告訴我，利用破舊的軍服、棉花和軍帽，加上火硝和硫磺，就能製作出槍藥。",
      "output_sha256": "7b372f479d134caea03d1bed3bcbf4acf4a6c6678c94980f51514ea1b4fd353d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.541504,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "628ed27bad7128ce1ef78257159611c556cc01c63dcc5fa66807bd4383154171"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7b372f479d134caea03d1bed3bcbf4acf4a6c6678c94980f51514ea1b4fd353d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他還怕我不明白槍藥。",
      "output_sha256": "0381d04322fc3a2ae2983205c2f782a9e78c8a3937fe5546f10b1c2424c58a23",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "0381d04322fc3a2ae2983205c2f782a9e78c8a3937fe5546f10b1c2424c58a23",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他又說：",
      "output_sha256": "9c12856c58267174aaadca03b908d57f67662d7ea5bc0314ec2716031579b912",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c12856c58267174aaadca03b908d57f67662d7ea5bc0314ec2716031579b912",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“那就是做子彈。”",
      "output_sha256": "decd758c4af7d443a3a3fa90399f3962f5a15a8424b77fa90ee183a6fc1e10df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "decd758c4af7d443a3a3fa90399f3962f5a15a8424b77fa90ee183a6fc1e10df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我就問他：",
      "output_sha256": "1f6a0dfbf5e688e2231b09e67a852469594f4df505243dacf36c4a5bed97dc31",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f6a0dfbf5e688e2231b09e67a852469594f4df505243dacf36c4a5bed97dc31",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“你怎麼曉得做子彈？”",
      "output_sha256": "1e90b3763545ff93c3f85711f53226247020d3598c7e440a707915cc6b997c19",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e90b3763545ff93c3f85711f53226247020d3598c7e440a707915cc6b997c19",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他說他打過賀龍，在湖南。",
      "output_sha256": "b36b9a12645f9c189e48518caaae899aad21601bdfa8c93b7dbc8450892d5d66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "b36b9a12645f9c189e48518caaae899aad21601bdfa8c93b7dbc8450892d5d66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“你那時候是當官嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "b4ffdc2f64ef88286233bce1f7be5893bd0fa56715b7e7178f216cbd067a63d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4ffdc2f64ef88286233bce1f7be5893bd0fa56715b7e7178f216cbd067a63d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "當兵嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "51e24ffa5a894c2857d089a8ca694ce01e482373e866837a72a256d62bc5275f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "51e24ffa5a894c2857d089a8ca694ce01e482373e866837a72a256d62bc5275f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他說他當兵，還當過班長。",
      "output_sha256": "d225c54189336293a6561b25002c289857a4105306d9138f66da35f232bc40d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "d225c54189336293a6561b25002c289857a4105306d9138f66da35f232bc40d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "打了兩年。",
      "output_sha256": "4c1a73500db4000707194e467ad1f21725846723f842adbe0a276bd01426c0a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c1a73500db4000707194e467ad1f21725846723f842adbe0a276bd01426c0a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "隨後他問我：“你知道共黨嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "a9fefacec864cddb94c363ea46267977dea0950992e01d609dbd0694e6d37ca8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.652273,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32,
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0a0099be8f278612c4379ba12e3651247b0b83b418f746b42f5dbbff63af479c",
        "7095b6b705ceb3632b2a793752827df84e8ebeed37b1afd48a87819e0045d2b5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a9fefacec864cddb94c363ea46267977dea0950992e01d609dbd0694e6d37ca8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "打賀龍就是打共黨。”",
      "output_sha256": "5aefe714122edcdf0efe703b5641ff57086f4ef03a368d4bc5417b5838768047",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "5aefe714122edcdf0efe703b5641ff57086f4ef03a368d4bc5417b5838768047",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我聽說。”",
      "output_sha256": "58626ff0bfb82ec2c0547d7fb5adeccf4fd1033bc3eb005767f7ba2c9559fa30",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "58626ff0bfb82ec2c0547d7fb5adeccf4fd1033bc3eb005767f7ba2c9559fa30",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "接著我問他：“你知道現在的共黨已經編成八路軍了嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "6c9697a6b0a52c5e9863c1ba80bf49ced59549ef26b59ee53222e6cb2c7774fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.78666,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "60bf0b041cf894d67e802a8ae0d0c6c0e6cbca92e7b09d586ba1819724e4f0cb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6c9697a6b0a52c5e9863c1ba80bf49ced59549ef26b59ee53222e6cb2c7774fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“呵！",
      "output_sha256": "ec57a80c3154d9ef0067785e778112e8bf20eb0291e3adaa850abc13bd48b689",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec57a80c3154d9ef0067785e778112e8bf20eb0291e3adaa850abc13bd48b689",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這我還不知道。”",
      "output_sha256": "e4b859bf749503ef8b24b7bb1155b2751baa10561ce06bd2dc34f60038fa1c59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4b859bf749503ef8b24b7bb1155b2751baa10561ce06bd2dc34f60038fa1c59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“也是打日本。”",
      "output_sha256": "6b99a99d222db51ff006c42ab4f5ad679e32e8d26b76addd15393e07f9e983aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "6b99a99d222db51ff006c42ab4f5ad679e32e8d26b76addd15393e07f9e983aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“對呀！",
      "output_sha256": "212d1f2ea71af7491b5abf871e043464945f4b1e43081a0f917dd380d35c8a0b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "212d1f2ea71af7491b5abf871e043464945f4b1e43081a0f917dd380d35c8a0b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "國家到了危難的時候，還能自己打什麼呢？",
      "output_sha256": "dc06cfb036bb234e858b66dbff4e540f4d6efaa5f9c041b0fe06a0ae633fe148",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.896658,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d9927d6fc7ca95f55705c350feb6380adb6ffa3267dce8715ac83cb38de8eeb4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dc06cfb036bb234e858b66dbff4e540f4d6efaa5f9c041b0fe06a0ae633fe148",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一齊槍口對外。”",
      "output_sha256": "82f2b27fef75d1c1860109069b6e4183f66e8cb6f0a0fbd50f2f4f46df89b457",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "82f2b27fef75d1c1860109069b6e4183f66e8cb6f0a0fbd50f2f4f46df89b457",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他思索了一會：“也是歸蔣委員長領導吧？”",
      "output_sha256": "1d0b2983ee25e66e180475409baf3f5b6c50d7fbae2451fe4f2ee3ae800851bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.637816,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "826e6819f66a7998c80d6e124cd8b340642eadc8208f7204c5118c3ba702672b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1d0b2983ee25e66e180475409baf3f5b6c50d7fbae2451fe4f2ee3ae800851bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是的。”",
      "output_sha256": "0c503dccc537ab040c8888eb287b2e8c20d044a919a13a47d1eeaf47fa4cc518",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c503dccc537ab040c8888eb287b2e8c20d044a919a13a47d1eeaf47fa4cc518",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這時候，前邊的那個轎伕一聲不響。",
      "output_sha256": "d6a5cdda3a1981f4b54f8d45ab96ee16a5089f4c2eef55192233e981b359881f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6a5cdda3a1981f4b54f8d45ab96ee16a5089f4c2eef55192233e981b359881f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "轎杆在肩上，一會兒換換左手，一會兒又換換右手。",
      "output_sha256": "3898108f6ca7c55e1c5299862d16fd1691b481522a965bd164e76006f06ea540",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "3898108f6ca7c55e1c5299862d16fd1691b481522a965bd164e76006f06ea540",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "後面的轎伕則接連發表意見：“小日本不可怕，最怕心不齊。",
      "output_sha256": "627dd935e56501cda0a5797ca3114e7b4548795c3b35765d0c79ba0999110fcd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.595716,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47,
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d76fdd0e6351a6a4a404ad645ccf7c6f7ff555aaf4c34d06abc9ef0745ff8b39",
        "0f70eea1fcb4332f5e30c29b2e5b84427d69f84e43e8a79a2aae1b8ffd1ec708"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "627dd935e56501cda0a5797ca3114e7b4548795c3b35765d0c79ba0999110fcd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "中國人心齊，他就治不了。",
      "output_sha256": "36aeac5c0cbf525e02fb34e21a9ec6c271467cfd2268fa127fb63155d67fec37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "36aeac5c0cbf525e02fb34e21a9ec6c271467cfd2268fa127fb63155d67fec37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "前幾天飛機來炸，炸在朝天門，那有什麼用！",
      "output_sha256": "65145a6cefce4137dd62f73b6f97b9913fc172e637b10ed67fc7069a419c68cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.719603,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50,
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c09cd9b8c2064b4f5dacc75269ff5f198c3388ce274c71fa7874e58b5aeca45a",
        "db778e5726b2b87b6a5d351c7f541f200817bb9962c8e27f48284dc645b0dfde"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "65145a6cefce4137dd62f73b6f97b9913fc172e637b10ed67fc7069a419c68cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "飛機炸了就佔了中國？",
      "output_sha256": "4b0cc24029ae7ca3fffd90041d2af2be7ca750ecc068421dba3eb9cd8eb6bd54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.826307,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5dcdf92ecad98458e5b2dcb6cea4e9b84e2723119c849ea9ded871cc883d799e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4b0cc24029ae7ca3fffd90041d2af2be7ca750ecc068421dba3eb9cd8eb6bd54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們可不能講和，講和就白亡了國。",
      "output_sha256": "1658c052f3404ce2c5adf7b7e5e5a26491aea6816a88ae77074d8f5a0c31b75e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "1658c052f3404ce2c5adf7b7e5e5a26491aea6816a88ae77074d8f5a0c31b75e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "日本人壞呀！",
      "output_sha256": "0a15a2184b84b5a51314231a2853826f25857aa3b2bc16e4aea1ca7c6665b747",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a15a2184b84b5a51314231a2853826f25857aa3b2bc16e4aea1ca7c6665b747",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "日本人狠哪！",
      "output_sha256": "122b9ab238fcff08cf91e583bf8c2af5b793309cb3a54d906985faa0ebe6ee05",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "122b9ab238fcff08cf91e583bf8c2af5b793309cb3a54d906985faa0ebe6ee05",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "報紙上去年沒少畫他們殺中國人的圖。",
      "output_sha256": "ec52b2591483ff2ba036568f24099abb3bbd60bf96ed3192411efd61370aea4d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec52b2591483ff2ba036568f24099abb3bbd60bf96ed3192411efd61370aea4d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們中國人對待俘虜一律優待。",
      "output_sha256": "df33851e2c3dcf00433f677260475ec25157a8f82efa030f0fbaac0abc4dea46",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.678879,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dacc6f4e78df8905139d6e6c56a9728dfd2f71fd5daf0591977a1f5f830cd95c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "df33851e2c3dcf00433f677260475ec25157a8f82efa030f0fbaac0abc4dea46",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可是說日本人也不全壞，說是不當兵不行，抓上船就載到中國來……”",
      "output_sha256": "f31f8011a1ee34eb8c0fcbd5826157617091a01f4f0eea13ac32bf5b754ad7ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.913248,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "54335dbbc526fdf2aa3f51755be75a14cf33c711b4172d17bd913c67a1503262"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f31f8011a1ee34eb8c0fcbd5826157617091a01f4f0eea13ac32bf5b754ad7ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是的……老百姓也和中國老百姓一樣好。",
      "output_sha256": "fefd05611548624c2ac5a207499c3afaa3b31895503c562f49820ef5c1983b19",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "fefd05611548624c2ac5a207499c3afaa3b31895503c562f49820ef5c1983b19",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "就是日本軍閥壞……”我回答他。",
      "output_sha256": "9530fe960fa31b6d6b623cb2bf52e70ca7d6c26c60a96c1dbc3af47ab796a9ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "9530fe960fa31b6d6b623cb2bf52e70ca7d6c26c60a96c1dbc3af47ab796a9ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "快要上高坡了，一過前面的石板橋，隔著一座山頭又看見另一座山頭。",
      "output_sha256": "d76ba76f849dc81121699dae614b52ddc3680b1f3da577638ef32e2add3c0873",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.607092,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "38c041d4b3fb8f33885f0e60757284de2a90fcaecdb4591a6ed0360dae4e7717"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d76ba76f849dc81121699dae614b52ddc3680b1f3da577638ef32e2add3c0873",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "雲煙從那座山緩緩沉降，降至山腰，依然往下沉落，一道深灰色，一道淺灰色的大團遊絲似的纏繞著山腰。",
      "output_sha256": "879b69371e378d5aec1bd3739a7b368b7246889f0d1fa0be95ed50c6d9576da7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.611695,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4fc66d4428a27aef740cda0d2b0e4575d0c53341f24ed6d2e9a42c1941e5e3b2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "879b69371e378d5aec1bd3739a7b368b7246889f0d1fa0be95ed50c6d9576da7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的轎子要繞過那個有云煙的尖頂的山。",
      "output_sha256": "167e2057be2965fbb9595d701f317e0523831bb64081d937622827c3066bf63a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "167e2057be2965fbb9595d701f317e0523831bb64081d937622827c3066bf63a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "兩位轎伕都開始感到吃力。",
      "output_sha256": "5f9ce7df0ba90f8f0abae910b793de702a0088917d6b758f5d349ef5782381ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.656818,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aa77473c124f4307d81993fa6d4fc8a8cd4698d9b72f12d5faae71e6004b7ce4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5f9ce7df0ba90f8f0abae910b793de702a0088917d6b758f5d349ef5782381ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我能夠聽得見的，是後邊的這一個，喘息的聲音又開始了。",
      "output_sha256": "f98e1833d0a41467fe5ad0a82bde4235f8e8b53ecd758698d6a7e701e01eb007",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "f98e1833d0a41467fe5ad0a82bde4235f8e8b53ecd758698d6a7e701e01eb007",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "聽到他的聲音，我的腦海便浮現出海上呼吸的蛤蟆，因為他的聲音帶著起伏、擴張和呼煽的感覺。",
      "output_sha256": "0f24492450563129733735aefbfb3b61002c5b526baca1b207cfc6040915ab93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.607883,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        66,
        67
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "45821c228345bfaf766296ee13cc296b1c5f2fa03838757305eda944a279b902",
        "4c90063b5699e80f93727730e0d939d6184f96a5150ab2074e5fcec67e361c42"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0f24492450563129733735aefbfb3b61002c5b526baca1b207cfc6040915ab93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這時，他們腳下的刷刷聲音卻消失了，伴隨著呼吸的，是轎杆竹子的鳴叫。",
      "output_sha256": "4bd5873c5d8e31c4ea631ded3a1783ce1fde1adc031ce6dfb5e2d1c7571ee49e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.635345,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        68,
        69
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8321ce48eeadc7442a72a9e4d3fb3fd85944e018d84e538f02422995e952101d",
        "f9e379fc9dabb8e7ad1ba091f88c76c07c02e05c44414779d9732f6eeec9013d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4bd5873c5d8e31c4ea631ded3a1783ce1fde1adc031ce6dfb5e2d1c7571ee49e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "坐在轎子上的人，隨着他們沉重的腳步的起伏在一升一落的。",
      "output_sha256": "ef054c9c3052359a352df7e55b2a59e885034fed0657ea8023b9d1cf9800a470",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef054c9c3052359a352df7e55b2a59e885034fed0657ea8023b9d1cf9800a470",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那麼多的石級上，若有一個石級不留心踏滑了，連人帶轎子要一齊滾下山澗去。",
      "output_sha256": "fc8fb8ce90a31b0589c9491b466a1abeccf5ff3af3e173f1267f5b70a9fdd5b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc8fb8ce90a31b0589c9491b466a1abeccf5ff3af3e173f1267f5b70a9fdd5b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因爲山上的路只有二尺多寬，遇到迎面而來的轎子，往往是彼此摩擦着走過。",
      "output_sha256": "cfd8dd9ca03a967feff29318b62db11e081bb7f31fad915248b03d8933f787e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "cfd8dd9ca03a967feff29318b62db11e081bb7f31fad915248b03d8933f787e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若摩擦得厲害，誰若依著山澗的一側，誰就會滾下山澗去。",
      "output_sha256": "4095c1353ed160a038d2e5c4dab29b354d11396cdb7ccac70129009f9794f333",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": 0.672778,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        73
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d8f1f37884b6166b029b66d0ee2239044d63547423a0cd8d7fee5bdd5e14b066"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4095c1353ed160a038d2e5c4dab29b354d11396cdb7ccac70129009f9794f333",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "山峯在前邊那麼高，高得插進雲霄似的。",
      "output_sha256": "f245b742940f80410612a2a4b5f33d56a6bd8311622b4fafb90abcb93dfcaba6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "f245b742940f80410612a2a4b5f33d56a6bd8311622b4fafb90abcb93dfcaba6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "山壁有的地方掛着一條小小的流泉，這流泉從山頂上一直掛到深澗中。",
      "output_sha256": "4ca2da1be01f3956e80880abd96258697250c4d24d3ec2e3cd9f9a6698c9fff9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ca2da1be01f3956e80880abd96258697250c4d24d3ec2e3cd9f9a6698c9fff9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再從澗底流到另一面天地去，就是說，從山的這面又流到山的那面去了。",
      "output_sha256": "7fc016c7be6c6ca83fbbeebe498e725ba823d50368a32adf6f22a5bee4f8abe8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "7fc016c7be6c6ca83fbbeebe498e725ba823d50368a32adf6f22a5bee4f8abe8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "同時流泉們發着唧鈴鈴的聲音。",
      "output_sha256": "44da8a6d8e64cbcba078a384c3f0e7a588533cbb91df6c2812c4437bec0e5e4c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_human_sha256": "44da8a6d8e64cbcba078a384c3f0e7a588533cbb91df6c2812c4437bec0e5e4c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "山風陰森地浸着人的皮膚。",
      "output_sha256": "0c667d28ac13c8823ce7fffd235cf3dfa6d776f3f0a2a9fd4e1645f397d3d4bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c667d28ac13c8823ce7fffd235cf3dfa6d776f3f0a2a9fd4e1645f397d3d4bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這時候，真有點害怕，可是轉頭一看，在山澗的邊上都掛着人，在亂草中，耙子的聲音刷刷地響着。",
      "output_sha256": "3e0e348d70fcf3f00f281b69dcbf757d21e2fc4f1b16a940a00560fe3a7175c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 79,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e0e348d70fcf3f00f281b69dcbf757d21e2fc4f1b16a940a00560fe3a7175c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "原來是女人和小孩子在集着野柴。",
      "output_sha256": "a76fcf0cd6c1789137e70796527163ddf65793820767ceb3fa962b53230ae792",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 80,
      "source_human_sha256": "a76fcf0cd6c1789137e70796527163ddf65793820767ceb3fa962b53230ae792",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "後邊的轎伕說：",
      "output_sha256": "eed5119e117f076df38a88b8e1d26b9216d69982a599f2300d94e4372a0d1bf6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 81,
      "source_human_sha256": "eed5119e117f076df38a88b8e1d26b9216d69982a599f2300d94e4372a0d1bf6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“共黨編成了八路軍，這我還不知道。",
      "output_sha256": "571823dafa059b0610ab6bc79319e47a3e843182e8f736a1061dbdc3deab597b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 82,
      "source_human_sha256": "571823dafa059b0610ab6bc79319e47a3e843182e8f736a1061dbdc3deab597b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "整天忙生活……連報紙也不常看(他說過他在軍隊常看報紙)……整天忙生活對於國家就疏忽了……”",
      "output_sha256": "3f799faefee3b218e1c1acd5827393976b5f00d7dd5e204f8df6337a943e76c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 83,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f799faefee3b218e1c1acd5827393976b5f00d7dd5e204f8df6337a943e76c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "正是在拔坡的時候，他的話和轎杆的聲響交錯在一起。",
      "output_sha256": "c86dccb674394f5270104134deba48ef7cb64ec8095cbca07dc35243831f211c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": 0.78666,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        84
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3870fdc79cda20e9b76e8c4d648a90f01aaf224b90a45fc038ed064ffd129cf2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c86dccb674394f5270104134deba48ef7cb64ec8095cbca07dc35243831f211c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "對於滑竿，我想他倆的肩膀，本來是肩不起的，但也肩起了。",
      "output_sha256": "ceaa0b1df5d9b89014bfd2a364db0b6e89a45a46cbb1b32ae22c316c9fc51eb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 85,
      "source_human_sha256": "ceaa0b1df5d9b89014bfd2a364db0b6e89a45a46cbb1b32ae22c316c9fc51eb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "本來不應該擔在他們的肩上的，但他們也擔起了。",
      "output_sha256": "78e4d50176bc8da5dce5278cb3e238f4e71ebb184d28a7096347631e2d85ffe1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 86,
      "source_human_sha256": "78e4d50176bc8da5dce5278cb3e238f4e71ebb184d28a7096347631e2d85ffe1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 82,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在承受不了的時候，他們便抽起大煙來支持自我。",
      "output_sha256": "83a28eba060768404312ca0ca3ddb906cb5cc0923b92590159222044f8392f89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": 0.485714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        87
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a1de8439de4b2a620ced0b1f8bd5dd67a8ed4656542647eb35d8cd924a255e52"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_ai_sha256": "83a28eba060768404312ca0ca3ddb906cb5cc0923b92590159222044f8392f89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 83,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "所以我總覺得擡著我的不僅僅是兩個人，而似乎是兩盞輕飄飄的煙燈。",
      "output_sha256": "9c2c10a67ed8cee0b39f4d7119521bdf1ad6f3a37d4154292dc1bd3b99a14516",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": 0.627594,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        88
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "100a0bb73f1cc7c1f39779af0aa812c2c93ef59bc06cc9c66a9babc9fe3b1c93"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9c2c10a67ed8cee0b39f4d7119521bdf1ad6f3a37d4154292dc1bd3b99a14516",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        72
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 84,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在重慶的交通運轉卻是掌握在他們的肩膀上的，就如黃河北的驢子，垂着頭的，細腿的，使馬看不起的驢子，也轉運着國家的軍糧。",
      "output_sha256": "824b29be054fd156f10247cf9a6718fb2c62d1d31ecb63d60c5c2a30baec9337",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 89,
